});
Source file object
path
Type: string
Example: '/tmp/dir/foo.js'

Resolved path to the file.

relativePath
Type: string
Example: 'dir/foo.js' if cwd was '/tmp'

Relative path to the file from cwd.

name
Type: string
Example: 'foo.js'

Filename with extension.

nameWithoutExtension
Type: string
Example: 'foo'

Filename without extension.

extension
Type: string
Example: 'js'

File extension.

